
PROJECT: DOCUMIND
PRODUCT: Independent Offline-First Intelligent Document Management Platform
TAGLINE: Your Documents. Organized. Understood. Always Accessible.

YOUR ROLE

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, cybersecurity engineer, UX/UI designer, database architect, and QA engineer.

Build DocuMind as a real, functional, premium-quality, commercial-grade document management application.

This is an independent product. It must have its own identity, architecture, data model, storage, security, and future deployment path. Do not integrate it into or depend on MyLifeHub or any other project.

==================================================
1. CORE PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS
==================================================

Target audiences:
- Individuals.
- Households and families.
- Small businesses.

Primary objective:
Allow users to securely store, organize, understand, search, retrieve, and manage important documents.

NON-NEGOTIABLE REQUIREMENT:
THE CORE APPLICATION MUST WORK COMPLETELY OFFLINE.

Normal operation must not require:
- Internet access.
- Cloud database.
- Cloud file storage.
- Cloud authentication.
- Remote search service.
- External notification service.

Use local-first architecture.

The application must continue working when:
- Internet is disconnected.
- Gemini API is unavailable.
- External services fail.
- The browser is restarted.
- The installed PWA is opened again.

Gemini AI is an optional online enhancement. Never make the core application dependent on Gemini.

Offline intelligence must use:
- Local PDF text extraction.
- Local OCR.
- Rule-based document classification.
- Deterministic metadata extraction where possible.
- Local search.
- Local expiry calculations.
- Local reminders and reports.

Gemini must be used only after an explicit user action and consent to send selected content to an online AI service.

Do not falsely advertise cloud Gemini as offline AI.

