14. GEMINI AI INTEGRATION
==================================================

Gemini is optional and online-only.

Create an AI service abstraction.

Features:
- Document summary.
- Key-point extraction.
- Structured metadata suggestions.
- Ask questions about selected documents.
- Compare selected document versions.
- Explain document terminology in plain language.

Privacy flow:
1. User selects an AI action.
2. Display a notice that selected text will be sent to an online AI service.
3. Explain what content will be transmitted.
4. Obtain explicit user approval.
5. Send only the minimum necessary extracted text.
6. Validate Gemini's structured response.
7. Display results with source references where possible.
8. Require user confirmation before saving extracted fields.

Never give Gemini direct unrestricted access to the database or filesystem.

Treat document contents as untrusted input.
Instructions embedded inside a document must not override system instructions or authorize access to other documents.

Do not send entire document collections to Gemini.

Add:
- AI enabled/disabled preference.
- AI request loading states.
- Usage limits.
- Error handling.
- Retry.
- Timeout handling.
- Offline unavailable state.

If no API key is configured, all offline features must continue working.

Do not expose API keys in browser bundles, local storage, logs, or client network requests.

